{"articleNo":"228314","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=228314&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2019년도 (재)포항시장학회 장학생 선발 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2019.08.21","hit":"5942","attachments":[{"name":"(재)포항시장학회 공고문.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=228314&attachNo=82180"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">2019년도 (재)포항시장학회 장학생 선발을 알려드리오니 많은 지원 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1. 신청자격: 대학교 재학생으로 본인 또는 보호자가 선발 공고일 현재 1년 이상 계속하여 포항시에 거주하는 자</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">2. 접수기간</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; 1차) 온라인 접수</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 2019. 8. 20.(화) ~ 9. 9(월) 18:00</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2차) 서류 접수:&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;1차 인터넷 접수 합격자에 한하여 제출</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span></span>2019. 9. 16.(월) ~ 9. 27.(금) 18:00</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;